<title>USA: Northern Trust names global forex chief.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust names global forex chief.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Northern Trust Corp appointed Patrick McDougal as director of its global foreign exchange operation, effective Friday, a bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>McDougal will oversee a total staff of 33 in offices in Chicago, London and Singapore. He replaces Jack Hogge, who is retiring from the bank, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>McDougal had managed the Chicago foreign exchange operation.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk, 312-408-8750))</p>
